   134                              <1> ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   135                              <1> ; slab_create - allocate and initialise a new slab for the cache in EBX.
   136                              <1> ; Returns EAX = slab page base (0 on OOM).
   137                              <1> ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   138                              <1> slab_create:
